    {
      "Id": 2000703014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "她怎么了？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "最近一直没见到她，我就在想出了什么事。/n她似乎很久都没能上台了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030140",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 2,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30119,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊，她已经退出剧团了。/n在银河座这很常见，不过确实遗憾。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "很常见？　",
      "BgmFileName": "7",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030160",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 502,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 5,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30119,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 2,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "所以，她果然是被赶走了吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030161",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 110,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 4,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "倒也不是……。/n……不，你是肩负银河座下一代的人，应该告诉你。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我们并不是想赶她走。/n只是明确告诉了她一件事。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030180",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "在银河座下一期的计划里，不会把她算作演员战力。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030190",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "因此无法保障薪资和生活，/n即便如此，她还要继续等待机会吗？　",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030200",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……也就是战力外通知吗。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030210",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 2,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 25,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30119,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1050",
      "CharacterMotions": []
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "银河座始终向有才华的演员敞开大门，也不断进行星探活动。/n可真正能登台的人数终究有限。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030220",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "工作人员也是一样。只有能够创造出符合传统银河座之名的/n高质量舞台的人，才有存在价值。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030230",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "在这里，每个人都必须展现自己的实力，相互竞争。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030240",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "历，我记得你和她关系不错吧？/n……我理解你会在意，但不用太失落。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030250",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703029,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "毕竟大家都很看重你。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030260",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703030,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 29,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
