      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "一年过去，我升上了初二。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030310",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703037,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我不会再犯那样的错误。/n为了在银河座这个世界活下去，我舍弃了软弱。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030320",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703038,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 37,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "为了回应高层寄予的期待，/n为了让舞台成功，我不断登台……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030330",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000703039,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 38,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不知不觉间，除了排练以外，/n主动来和我说话的人越来越少。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20007030340",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
